#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/geofence.rst:3
#: 11af124551244aebbb34025a7142de50
msgid "Geofence"
msgstr "地理围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/geofence.rst:5
#: 9be73b1319044d3ea6b1c964693b5bc6
msgid ""
"The geofence represents a hard limit to where the UAV will not fly beyond. "
"It is useful for preventing runaway UAVs (barring other software/hardware "
"issues). If it breaches the fence the failsafe will be activated, returning "
"it to the home point."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏表示无人机不得飞越的硬性边界。在排除其他软硬件问题的前提下，它有助于防止无人机失控飞离。若无人机突破围栏，将激活失控保护，使其返回起始点。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/geofence.rst:10
#: 00def496552b4628ae0223a6bd5dc8b1
msgid ""
"It is represented as an arbitrary polygon of waypoints around the flying "
"area in a fixed-wing vehicle. In ArduCopter, it is a radius and altitude "
"parameter(s) representing a cylinder around the flying area."
msgstr "对于固定翼飞行器，围栏表示为飞行区域周围由航点构成的任意多边形。在ArduCopter中，围栏由代表飞行区域圆柱体的半径和高度参数表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/geofence.rst:14
#: 39f314c9df954e978b4f6fa8cb92f9f1
msgid "A fence menu is available on the GUI console."
msgstr "GUI控制台上提供围栏菜单。"

